47. A CMDB Administrator seeks to understand the available tools for preventing, 
addressing, and remediating duplicate CIs. Drag and drop each feature with the 
corresponding outcome. 
 
De-Duplication Tasks: Can be assigned to groups for resolving duplicate CIs. 
CMDB Health Dashboard Correctness Scorecard: Offers insight into duplicate CIs within the 
CMDB. 
De-Duplication Templates: Offers a solution to resolve de-duplication tasks in bulk 
Duplicate CI Remediator: Provides a wizard to resolve duplicate tasks individually. 
 
 

