49. A new ServiceNow customer is assembling a Configuration Management team to 
support their CMDB. Drag each role to its corresponding job description. 
 
CI Analyst: Has read-only access to CMDB data and to tools with a simple interface such as 
CMDB reports and dashboards. 
CMDB Process Owner: Obtains highest level role for CMDB privileges. 
Configuration Manager/CMDB Admin: Manages assigned CI tables and keeps records for 
those tables updated and resolves tasks related to CMDB. 
Service or Product Owner: Accountable for managing all elements that make up the service 
portfolio throughout their entire lifecycle. 
 
 
